the press.

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:18.810
He recently took the minority leader to task
for backing the one point two trillion dollar

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:23.660
bipartisan infrastructure package that passed
the Senate last month, calling the legislation

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:24.660
a disgrace.

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:30.180
Trump saying, quote, If Mitch McConnell was
smart, which we've seen no evidence of, he

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:34.160
would use the debt ceiling card to negotiate
a good infrastructure package.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:39.460
We'll actually talk a little bit about that
on the bonus show today as well.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:41.960
